{"id": "68153", "title": "没大没小", "author": "喜了", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68153.htm", "intro": "职业有贵贱，生命无高低。蒋大小虽身为下贱，心却比天明，比海阔，比妖灵。\r\n自有一番腌臜事业待她去开垦，上拉神佛，下踩鬼怪，中间牢牢秉持“职业道德”在野鸡界混出楷模。\r\n一只黄色小螳螂单打独斗的故事，原来软饭界也有职场，只要心正，顾良心，哪里都是修成正果的地方！ \r\n\r\n强烈个人风格作品。此文容易招人反感，请一定慎 入。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68153", "chapters": [{"title": "1-11", "file": "10511163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-23", "file": "10511164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-34", "file": "10511165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-45", "file": "10511166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-56", "file": "10511167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-67", "file": "10511168.html", "available": false}, {"title": "68-80", "file": "10511169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-92", "file": "10511170.html", "available": false}, {"title": "93-107", "file": "10511171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "108-125", "file": "10511172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "126-140", "file": "10511173.html", "available": false}, {"title": "141-150", "file": "10511174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "151-160", "file": "10511175.html", "available": false}, {"title": "161-170", "file": "10511176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "171-180", "file": "10511177.html", "available": false}, {"title": "181-193", "file": "10511178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "194-208完结", "file": "10511179.html", "available": false}]}